  "description": "Frosty Christmas is an elegant, graceful handwritten script font with flowing letterforms and delicate calligraphic strokes that bring a beautiful and festive touch to your holiday designs. Featuring uppercase and lowercase letters, numbers, punctuation, and special characters, this font is perfect for Christmas T-shirts, holiday cards, invitations, gift tags, stickers, branding, logos, social media graphics, seasonal decorations, and creative craft projects. Its smooth, stylish, and naturally handwritten appearance makes it ideal for elegant Christmas typography, personalized gifts, winter-themed artwork, and charming holiday creations. Add a touch of festive elegance and timeless beauty to your designs with Frosty Christmas by Artisan Vibes",
